<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>古建筑泛介绍</title>
  <style>
    html,
    body {
      width: 1527px;
      height: 740px;
      margin: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    body {
      font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
      padding: 24px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      background: #f5f0e6;
      color: #2f2417;
      line-height: 1.7;
      overflow: auto;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .section-grid {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .overview {
      display: block;
    }

    body.panel-mode .overview {
      display: none;
    }

    .section-card {
      width: 120px;
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #2f2417;
      background: #e7d7be;
      border: 1px solid #b89c72;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .section-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(47, 36, 23, 0.18);
    }

    .section-card:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid #7a5a2f;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .intro-panel {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: #fbf7ef;
      border: 1px solid #d6c3a1;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .intro-panel.visible {
      display: block;
    }

    body.panel-mode .intro-panel.visible {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .panel-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .panel-header h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .back-to-overview {
      border: 1px solid #b89c72;
      background: #f3e7d2;
      color: #3b2b17;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-family: inherit;
    }

    .top-nav {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      padding: 12px;
      background: #efe1c8;
      border: 1px solid #ccb187;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .top-nav a {
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #3b2b17;
      background: #f8efe0;
      border: 1px solid #d2b487;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: background 0.2s ease;
    }

    .top-nav a:hover {
      background: #e7d2ad;
    }

    .top-nav a.active {
      background: #d8b988;
      color: #2b1d0c;
    }

    .section {
      display: none;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      background: #fffaf0;
      border: 1px solid #e0cfb1;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .section.active {
      display: block;
    }

    .section h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .content-with-image {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: start;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .content-text p {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
    }

    .image-slot {
      min-height: 220px;
      background: #f2f2f2;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #6f6f6f;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 12px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .image-slot img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      max-height: 320px;
      object-fit: contain;
      display: block;
    }

    .roof-layout {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .roof-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 6px 0;
    }

    .roof-item.reverse .roof-image {
      order: 1;
    }

    .roof-item.reverse .roof-text {
      order: 2;
    }

    .roof-text h4 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #3b2b17;
    }

    .roof-text p {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
    }

    .desc-text {
      text-indent: 2em;
    }

    .roof-image img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      max-height: 320px;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 0;
      border: none;
      display: block;
    }

    #zhutigoujia,
    #qiangtigouzao,
    #shanqiangxingshi {
      position: relative;
      padding: 22px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: linear-gradient(125deg, rgba(43, 34, 24, 0.82), rgba(68, 52, 34, 0.65)), url('背景.jpg') center / cover no-repeat;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    #zhutigoujia::before,
    #qiangtigouzao::before,
    #shanqiangxingshi::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 15%, rgba(255, 210, 150, 0.22), transparent 45%), radial-gradient(circle at 85% 80%, rgba(255, 230, 190, 0.18), transparent 40%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    #zhutigoujia > *,
    #qiangtigouzao > *,
    #shanqiangxingshi > * {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    #zhutigoujia h3,
    #qiangtigouzao h3,
    #shanqiangxingshi h3 {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: #fff6e8;
      font-size: 28px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .gable-layout {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    .gable-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 6px 0;
      color: #f4ecde;
    }

    .gable-item + .gable-item {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 237, 210, 0.24);
      padding-top: 24px;
    }

    .gable-item.reverse .gable-image {
      order: 1;
    }

    .gable-item.reverse .gable-text {
      order: 2;
    }

    .gable-text h4 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: #fff8ea;
      font-size: 26px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    }

    .gable-text p {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: rgba(255, 245, 228, 0.94);
    }

    .gable-image img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 260px;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
    }

    #zhutigoujia .image-slot,
    #qiangtigouzao .image-slot,
    #shanqiangxingshi .image-slot {
      min-height: 260px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      color: #fff4de;
      border-radius: 0;
    }

    #zhutigoujia .gable-image {
      min-height: 320px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    #zhutigoujia .gable-image img {
      width: auto;
      height: auto;
      max-width: 100%;
      max-height: 320px;
      object-fit: contain;
    }

    #zhutigoujia .gable-image.is-landscape img {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 430px;
      height: 230px;
      max-height: none;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    #zhutigoujia .gable-image.is-portrait img {
      width: 66%;
      max-width: 230px;
      height: 320px;
      max-height: none;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    #wudinggouzao {
      position: relative;
      padding: 22px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: linear-gradient(125deg, rgba(43, 34, 24, 0.82), rgba(68, 52, 34, 0.65)), url('背景.jpg') center / cover no-repeat;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    #wudinggouzao::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 15%, rgba(255, 210, 150, 0.22), transparent 45%), radial-gradient(circle at 85% 80%, rgba(255, 230, 190, 0.18), transparent 40%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    #wudinggouzao > * {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    #wudinggouzao h3 {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: #fff6e8;
      font-size: 28px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    #wudinggouzao .roof-item {
      gap: 24px;
      color: #f4ecde;
    }

    #wudinggouzao .roof-item + .roof-item {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 237, 210, 0.24);
      padding-top: 24px;
    }

    #wudinggouzao .roof-text h4 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: #fff8ea;
      font-size: 26px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    }

    #wudinggouzao .roof-text p {
      color: rgba(255, 245, 228, 0.94);
    }

    #wudinggouzao .roof-image img {
      width: auto;
      height: auto;
      max-width: 100%;
      max-height: 320px;
      object-fit: contain;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
    }

    #wudinggouzao .roof-image {
      min-height: 320px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    #wudinggouzao .roof-image.is-landscape img {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 430px;
      height: 230px;
      max-height: none;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    #wudinggouzao .roof-image.is-portrait img {
      width: 66%;
      max-width: 230px;
      height: 320px;
      max-height: none;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    #wudinggouzao .image-slot {
      min-height: 260px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      color: #fff4de;
      border-radius: 0;
    }

    .material-nebula-wrap {
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid #d8c09c;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(243, 225, 194, 0.85), rgba(236, 215, 180, 0.55) 35%, rgba(250, 242, 228, 0.95) 100%);
      overflow: auto;
    }

    .material-filter-drawer {
      position: fixed;
      left: 10px;
      top: 110px;
      z-index: 1000;
      display: flex;
      align-items: stretch;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .material-filter-toggle {
      border: 1px solid rgba(184, 150, 103, 0.82);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: rgba(247, 233, 205, 0.78);
      color: #3d2e1b;
      padding: 10px 10px;
      min-width: 50px;
      font-size: 13px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: inherit;
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    }

    .material-filter-panel {
      width: 0;
      opacity: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-left: 0;
      transition: width 0.25s ease, opacity 0.25s ease, margin-left 0.25s ease;
      background: rgba(255, 249, 238, 0.82);
      border: 1px solid rgba(188, 158, 113, 0.84);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      backdrop-filter: blur(7px);
      max-height: 78vh;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .material-filter-drawer.expanded .material-filter-panel {
      width: 330px;
      opacity: 1;
      margin-left: 8px;
      padding: 10px;
    }

    .material-filter-title {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #3a2a18;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .filter-layer {
      border: 1px solid rgba(202, 172, 130, 0.8);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: rgba(255, 253, 247, 0.72);
      padding: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .filter-layer summary {
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #4a341d;
      font-size: 13px;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .filter-layer summary::-webkit-details-marker {
      display: none;
    }

    .filter-layer summary::before {
      content: '�?;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-right: 6px;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .filter-layer[open] summary::before {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }

    .filter-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .filter-tag {
      border: 1px solid #ccb38a;
      background: rgba(255, 247, 232, 0.92);
      color: #47321d;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.3;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: inherit;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .filter-tag:hover {
      background: #f3e2c1;
    }

    .filter-tag.active {
      background: #d8b988;
      border-color: #b48549;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .material-galaxy-board {
      position: relative;
      width: 1380px;
      max-width: 100%;
      height: 980px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px dashed rgba(123, 89, 49, 0.36);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(133, 94, 53, 0.16), rgba(255, 249, 236, 0.72) 45%, rgba(255, 251, 242, 1) 100%);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .material-region-watermark {
      position: absolute;
      right: 16px;
      top: 14px;
      font-size: 34px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      color: rgba(104, 74, 41, 0.12);
      pointer-events: none;
      user-select: none;
      white-space: nowrap;
      display: none;
    }

    .material-clear-filter {
      position: absolute;
      right: 14px;
      top: 14px;
      z-index: 2;
      border: 1px solid #bc9562;
      background: rgba(246, 232, 206, 0.94);
      color: #4a341d;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-family: inherit;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .material-clear-filter.visible {
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .material-clear-filter:hover {
      background: #dfbe89;
      color: #2f2111;
    }

    .material-cluster {
      position: absolute;
      width: 320px;
      height: 320px;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    }

    .cluster-center,
    .cluster-orbit {
      position: absolute;
      border: 1px solid #b89567;
      color: #352614;
      font-family: inherit;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .cluster-center {
      left: 50%;
      top: 50%;
      width: 108px;
      height: 108px;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #ccab74;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(74, 51, 25, 0.26);
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .cluster-center.related {
      animation: centerPulse 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(114, 83, 46, 0.35), 0 6px 16px rgba(74, 51, 25, 0.26);
    }

    .cluster-center.unrelated {
      opacity: 0.3;
    }

    @keyframes centerPulse {
      0% {
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(114, 83, 46, 0.35), 0 6px 16px rgba(74, 51, 25, 0.26);
      }
      70% {
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 18px rgba(114, 83, 46, 0), 0 6px 16px rgba(74, 51, 25, 0.26);
      }
      100% {
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(114, 83, 46, 0), 0 6px 16px rgba(74, 51, 25, 0.26);
      }
    }

    .cluster-orbit {
      width: 96px;
      min-height: 46px;
      padding: 5px 8px;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 249, 239, 0.96);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .cluster-orbit:hover,
    .cluster-orbit:focus-visible,
    .cluster-center:hover,
    .cluster-center:focus-visible {
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.04);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(64, 44, 21, 0.24);
      outline: none;
    }

    .material-cluster.search-dim .cluster-center {
      opacity: 0.42;
    }

    .material-cluster.search-dim .cluster-orbit {
      opacity: 0.2;
    }

    .material-cluster .cluster-links {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .material-cluster .cluster-link {
      stroke: rgba(90, 67, 40, 0.18);
      stroke-width: 1.2;
      opacity: 0.05;
      transition: stroke 0.25s ease, opacity 0.25s ease;
    }

    .material-cluster .cluster-link.active {
      stroke: #7b5a2f;
      stroke-width: 1.6;
      opacity: 0.92;
      stroke-dasharray: 4 5;
      animation: lineFlow 1.2s linear infinite;
    }

    @keyframes lineFlow {
      from {
        stroke-dashoffset: 0;
      }
      to {
        stroke-dashoffset: -18;
      }
    }

    .cluster-orbit.filter-hit {
      color: #2f2212;
      border-color: rgba(95, 70, 39, 0.72);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(56, 40, 20, 0.2);
      opacity: 1 !important;
    }

    .cluster-orbit.filter-hit.cat-wood {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #edd3a8, #c19050);
    }

    .cluster-orbit.filter-hit.cat-stone {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #d1dbdb, #717d7d);
    }

    .cluster-orbit.filter-hit.cat-brick {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #edc9b8, #b36745);
    }

    .cluster-orbit.filter-hit.cat-earth {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #f0d98e, #d4a017);
    }

    .cluster-orbit.filter-hit.cat-lime {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ece6d9, #c7b69a);
    }

    .cluster-orbit.filter-hit.cat-bamboo {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #d8e1b7, #8ca15d);
    }

    .cluster-orbit.filter-hit.cat-tile {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #d2d8e2, #7c8798);
    }

    .cluster-orbit.filter-dim {
      background: rgba(217, 217, 217, 0.2);
      border-color: rgba(146, 146, 146, 0.45);
      color: rgba(90, 90, 90, 0.72);
      box-shadow: none;
      opacity: 0.2 !important;
    }

    .material-tip {
      margin: 10px 2px 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #6b5232;
    }

    .material-modal[hidden] {
      display: none;
    }

    .material-modal {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 1200;
    }

    .material-modal-backdrop {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(20, 14, 8, 0.45);
    }

    .material-modal-dialog {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      width: min(620px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 8vh auto 0;
      background: #fff9ef;
      border: 1px solid #cfb38a;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(38, 24, 8, 0.26);
      padding: 14px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .material-modal-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .material-modal-header h4 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      color: #2f2417;
    }

    .material-modal-close {
      border: 1px solid #c6a67a;
      background: #f8ecd8;
      color: #3b2b17;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 5px 10px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-family: inherit;
    }

    .material-modal-content p {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: #3a2d1d;
    }

    .material-modal-image {
      margin-top: 6px;
      min-height: 180px;
      border: 1px dashed #ccb187;
      background: #f6f1e7;
      color: #6f5a3d;
    }

    .material-modal-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .material-modal-tag {
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid #cfb38a;
      background: #fbf0dd;
      color: #4b341d;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 3px 9px;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    #jianzaogongyi {
      padding: 0;
      background: #fdf9f2;
      border: 1px solid #e0cfb1;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      overflow-y: hidden;
    }

    .craft-flow-container {
      position: relative;
      width: 3400px;
      height: 400px;
      margin: 20px;
    }

    .craft-flow-lines {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .craft-flow-line {
      stroke: #b89c72;
      stroke-width: 2px;
      fill: none;
    }

    .craft-flow-nodes {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
    }

    .craft-node {
      position: absolute;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 140px;
      height: 60px;
      background: #e7d7be;
      border: 1px solid #b89c72;
      border-radius: 50%; /* Creates the oval shape */
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #2f2417;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 5px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .craft-node:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.05);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(47, 36, 23, 0.18);
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .craft-flow-container {
        width: 4000px; /* Increase width for smaller screens */
        height: 500px;
      }
      .craft-node {
        width: 160px;
        height: 70px;
      }
    }
    
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .content-with-image {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .roof-item,
      .roof-item.reverse {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .gable-item,
      .gable-item.reverse {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .roof-item.reverse .roof-image,
      .roof-item.reverse .roof-text {
        order: unset;
      }

      .gable-item.reverse .gable-image,
      .gable-item.reverse .gable-text {
        order: unset;
      }

      .gable-text h4 {
        font-size: 22px;
      }

      #wudinggouzao .roof-text h4 {
        font-size: 22px;
      }

      #wudinggouzao .roof-image.is-landscape img,
      #wudinggouzao .roof-image.is-portrait img {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 100%;
        height: 240px;
      }

      #zhutigoujia .gable-image.is-landscape img,
      #zhutigoujia .gable-image.is-portrait img {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 100%;
        height: 240px;
      }

      .material-galaxy-board {
        width: 1200px;
        height: 1220px;
      }

      .material-cluster {
        width: 280px;
        height: 280px;
      }

      .cluster-center {
        width: 98px;
        height: 98px;
        font-size: 18px;
      }

      .cluster-orbit {
        width: 88px;
        min-height: 44px;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .material-modal-dialog {
        width: calc(100% - 24px);
        margin-top: 5vh;
      }

      .material-filter-drawer {
        top: 88px;
        left: 6px;
      }

      .material-filter-drawer.expanded .material-filter-panel {
        width: 290px;
      }

      .material-region-watermark {
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .material-clear-filter {
        top: 10px;
        right: 10px;
        padding: 4px 10px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="overview" id="overview">
    <h1>古建筑泛介绍</h1>
    <div class="section-grid">
      <a class="section-card" href="#" data-panel-target="buildingStructurePanel">建筑结构</a>
      <a class="section-card" href="#" data-panel-target="buildingCraftPanel">建造工�?/a>
      <a class="section-card" href="#" data-panel-target="buildingMaterialPanel">建造材�?/a>
      <a class="section-card" href="#" data-panel-target="buildingAestheticsPanel">建筑美学</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="intro-panel" id="buildingStructurePanel">
    <div class="panel-header">
      <h2>建筑结构</h2>
      <button class="back-to-overview" id="closeBuildingStructure" type="button">收起介绍</button>
    </div>

    <nav class="top-nav">
      <a href="#zhutigoujia" data-target="zhutigoujia">主体构架</a>
      <a href="#qiangtigouzao" data-target="qiangtigouzao">墙体构�?/a>
      <a href="#shanqiangxingshi" data-target="shanqiangxingshi">山墙形式</a>
      <a href="#wudinggouzao" data-target="wudinggouzao">屋顶构�?/a>
      <a href="#gongnenggouzao" data-target="gongnenggouzao">功能构�?/a>
      <a href="#dimantaiji" data-target="dimantaiji">地面台基</a>
      <a href="#pingmianbujv" data-target="pingmianbujv">平面布局</a>
    </nav>

    <section class="section" id="zhutigoujia">
      <h3>主体构架</h3>
      <div class="gable-layout">
        <article class="gable-item">
          <div class="gable-text">
            <h4>抬梁式构�?/h4>
            <p class="desc-text">以粗壮的梁柱为主要承重体系，柱子上承大梁，梁上再叠短梁，层层抬升托起檩条。整体构架开间开阔、空间规整，梁架厚重稳固，承重与抗风性能强，结构庄重大气，是北方官式与民居的主流木构架�?/p>
            <p class="desc-text">北京四合院、晋派大院木构架�?/p>
          </div>
          <div class="gable-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="详细介绍图片/抬梁式构�?
              data-src-fallbacks="抬梁式构�?
              alt="抬梁式构架示意图"
            />
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="gable-item reverse">
          <div class="gable-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="详细介绍图片/穿斗式构�?
              data-src-fallbacks="穿斗式构�?
              alt="穿斗式构架示意图"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="gable-text">
            <h4>穿斗式构�?/h4>
            <p class="desc-text">以密集立柱直接承托檩条，柱间用穿枋串联拉结，不依赖大型主梁。构架用料纤细、整体轻巧，整体性好、抗震能力突出，施工灵活省料，非常适合南方多雨潮湿、多风地震的环境�?/p>
            <p class="desc-text">江南民居、川派吊脚楼、徽派民居木构架�?/p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="gable-item">
          <div class="gable-text">
            <h4>土木混合构架</h4>
            <p class="desc-text">采用木柱、木梁承担屋顶重量，外墙与隔断则用夯土或青砖砌筑围护。结构因地制宜、造价经济，墙体厚实保温，既能节省木材，又能提升稳定性，广泛用于干旱与山地地区�?/p>
            <p class="desc-text">西北窑洞、华北乡村民居、西南山地民居�?/p>
          </div>
          <div class="gable-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="详细介绍图片/土木混合构架"
              data-src-fallbacks="土木混合构架"
              alt="土木混合构架示意�?
            />
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="gable-item reverse">
          <div class="gable-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="详细介绍图片/干栏式构�?
              data-src-fallbacks="详细介绍图片/杆栏式构�?干栏式构�?杆栏式构�?
              alt="干栏式构架示意图"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="gable-text">
            <h4>干栏式构�?/h4>
            <p class="desc-text">整栋房屋以木柱高架架空，底层悬空不住人，上层作为居住空间。架空结构能有效通风防潮、防虫蛇野兽，适应高温多雨、地势低洼的环境，是湿热地区典型的民居形式�?/p>
            <p class="desc-text">西南吊脚楼、傣族竹楼、闽粤山区民居�?/p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="qiangtigouzao">
      <h3>墙体构�?/h3>
      <div class="gable-layout">
        <article class="gable-item">
          <div class="gable-text">
            <h4>青砖实砌�?/h4>
            <p class="desc-text">以烧制青砖为原料，满浆满缝紧密砌筑，砖块咬合规整。质地坚硬密实、强度高，兼具承重与围护功能，防水耐用，质感温润�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>晋派大院高墙、北京四合院外墙、客家土楼外围墙�?/p>
          </div>
          <div class="gable-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="青砖实砌�?
              data-src-fallbacks="青砖实砌墙示意图,晋front,京front"
              alt="青砖实砌墙示意图"
            />
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="gable-item reverse">
          <div class="gable-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="青砖空斗�?
              data-src-fallbacks="青砖空斗墙示意图,苏front,徽front"
              alt="青砖空斗墙示意图"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="gable-text">
            <h4>青砖空斗�?/h4>
            <p class="desc-text">青砖采用空心构造砌筑，内部形成中空腔体。省料轻便，隔热隔音效果好，不承担承重，仅作为围护或隔断墙使用�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>苏派民居、皖派民居外墙、江南小院隔墙�?/p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="gable-item">
          <div class="gable-text">
            <h4>夯土�?/h4>
            <p class="desc-text">生土掺入稻草等分层夯实而成，墙体厚实紧实。保温隔热性突出，冬暖夏凉，取材方便、造价低廉，兼具承重与防护功能�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>福建土楼内墙、西北窑洞墙体、西南山地民居墙�?/p>
          </div>
          <div class="gable-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="夯土�?
              data-src-fallbacks="夯土墙示意图,闽front"
              alt="夯土墙示意图"
            />
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="gable-item reverse">
          <div class="gable-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="石砌�?
              data-src-fallbacks="石砌墙示意图,川front,海front"
              alt="石砌墙示意图"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="gable-text">
            <h4>石砌�?/h4>
            <p class="desc-text">选用天然石材砌筑，石块相互嵌合。硬度高、耐风化、抗侵蚀，结构稳固，常用于基础和外围墙，外观质朴厚重�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>福建石构民居、川滇山地民居、潮汕沿海民居墙�?/p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="gable-item">
          <div class="gable-text">
            <h4>竹编抹灰�?/h4>
            <p class="desc-text">竹篾编织成骨架，内外涂抹泥浆或石灰浆。轻便透气、韧性好，施工简单成本低，不承重，多作为内墙或隔断�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>西南吊脚楼、江南农家、傣族竹楼内墙墙体结构部分�?/p>
          </div>
          <div class="gable-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="竹编抹灰�?
              data-src-fallbacks="竹编抹灰墙示意图,川front"
              alt="竹编抹灰墙示意图"
            />
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="shanqiangxingshi">
      <h3>山墙形式</h3>
      <div class="gable-layout">
        <article class="gable-item">
          <div class="gable-text">
            <h4>马头�?/h4>
            <p class="desc-text">山墙呈阶梯状层层叠落，随屋面高度分段抬高，轮廓错落起伏，墙头微微上翘。整体层次清晰，造型挺拔，既能有效阻隔火势蔓延，又具有极强的装饰性，是极具辨识度的传统山墙形式�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>徽派宏村、西递民居、江南部分民居山墙�?/p>
          </div>
          <div class="gable-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="马头�?
              data-src-fallbacks="马头墙示意图,徽front"
              alt="马头墙示意图"
            />
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="gable-item reverse">
          <div class="gable-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="镬耳墙"
              data-src-fallbacks="镬耳墙示意�?粤front"
              alt="镬耳墙示意�?
            />
          </div>
          <div class="gable-text">
            <h4>镬耳墙</h4>
            <p class="desc-text">山墙顶部呈圆弧形隆起，形似锅耳，曲线饱满浑厚，两端向上收拢。墙体高大厚实，弧形顶部既增强了结构稳定性，又利于通风散热，整体庄重大气，装饰性与实用性兼备�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>岭南镬耳屋、潮汕民居、粤派围龙屋山墙�?/p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="gable-item">
          <div class="gable-text">
            <h4>平直硬山�?/h4>
            <p class="desc-text">山墙整体呈竖直平面，线条简洁笔直，与屋面齐平或略高于屋面。墙面平整规整，构造简单坚固，能有效包裹内部木构件，防风耐用，风格朴素沉稳�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>北京四合院、晋派大院、北方乡村民居山墙�?/p>
          </div>
          <div class="gable-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="平直硬山�?
              data-src-fallbacks="平直硬山墙示意图,京front,晋front"
              alt="平直硬山墙示意图"
            />
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="gable-item reverse">
          <div class="gable-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="弧形山墙"
              data-src-fallbacks="弧形山墙示意�?川front"
              alt="弧形山墙示意�?
            />
          </div>
          <div class="gable-text">
            <h4>弧形山墙</h4>
            <p class="desc-text">山墙整体为柔和的连续弧形，自上而下流畅弯曲，没有尖锐棱角。曲线舒缓自然，造型轻盈圆润，既美观又能分散受力，整体形态温婉而富有动感�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>川派民居、滇南民居、湘西少数民族民居山墙�?/p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="wudinggouzao">
      <h3>屋顶构�?/h3>
      <div class="roof-layout">
        <article class="roof-item">
          <div class="roof-text">
            <h4>硬山�?/h4>
            <p class="desc-text">屋顶两侧山墙与屋面齐平，无出檐，结构简单、防风性好，南北方民居最常用�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>北京四合院、晋派民居、江南普通民居屋顶�?/p>
          </div>
          <div class="roof-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="详细介绍图片/硬山�?
              data-src-fallbacks="详细介绍图片/硬山�?
              alt="硬山顶示意图"
            />
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="roof-item reverse">
          <div class="roof-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="详细介绍图片/悬山�?
              data-src-fallbacks="悬山�?悬山顶示意图"
              alt="悬山顶示意图"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="roof-text">
            <h4>悬山�?/h4>
            <p class="desc-text">屋顶两侧出檐，山墙低于屋面，排水、遮阳效果好，南方民居更常见�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>苏派民居、川派吊脚楼、徽派小型民居屋顶�?/p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="roof-item">
          <div class="roof-text">
            <h4>卷棚�?/h4>
            <p class="desc-text">屋顶无正脊，呈弧形，造型柔和，多用于民居厅堂、厢房，南方更普遍�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>江南民居厢房、岭南民居厅堂、部分徽派民居�?/p>
          </div>
          <div class="roof-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="详细介绍图片/卷棚�?
              data-src-fallbacks="卷棚顶示意图"
              alt="卷棚顶示意图"
            />
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="roof-item reverse">
          <div class="roof-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="详细介绍图片/攒尖�?
              data-src-fallbacks="攒尖顶示意图"
              alt="攒尖顶示意图"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="roof-text">
            <h4>攒尖�?/h4>
            <p class="desc-text">屋顶呈锥形，从四周向上汇聚至顶部宝顶，造型轻盈聚拢，结构精巧，多用于民居门楼、亭台楼阁�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>徽派民居门楼、闽派土楼附属亭台、江南园林亭子�?/p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="roof-item">
          <div class="roof-text">
            <h4>歇山�?/h4>
            <p class="desc-text">屋顶由前后左右四个坡面组成，上半段为两坡、下半段转为四坡，配一条正脊、四条垂脊与四条戗脊，层次丰富、兼具庄重与灵动，常见于民居宗祠、厅堂及园林主建筑�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>徽派宗祠享堂、闽派闽南大厝宗祠、江南园林主厅�?/p>
          </div>
          <div class="roof-image">
            <img
              data-src-base="详细介绍图片/歇山�?
              data-src-fallbacks="歇山顶示意图"
              alt="歇山顶示意图"
            />
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="gongnenggouzao">
      <h3>功能构�?/h3>
      <div class="roof-layout">
        <article class="roof-item">
          <div class="roof-text">
            <h4>架空防潮构�?/h4>
            <p><strong>介绍�?/strong>通过将房屋主体以密集立柱架空抬升，使居住层与地面完全脱离，形成通透的底层空间。底层空气流通顺畅，能有效隔绝地面潮气向上渗透，同时避免蛇虫鼠蚁侵扰，兼具实用性与适应性�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>西南吊脚楼、傣族竹楼、闽粤沿海民�?/p>
          </div>
          <div class="roof-image">
            <div class="image-slot">架空防潮构造配图待补充</div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="roof-item reverse">
          <div class="roof-image">
            <div class="image-slot">厚墙小窗构造配图待补充</div>
          </div>
          <div class="roof-text">
            <h4>厚墙小窗构�?/h4>
            <p><strong>介绍�?/strong>采用厚实的砖石或夯土砌筑墙体，搭配窄小的窗户设计。厚实墙体能阻挡外界冷热空气快速传导，起到优异的保温隔热效果，同时抵御冬季寒风与风沙侵袭；窄小窗户在保障室内采光的同时，增强了建筑的防御安全性�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>西北窑洞、晋派大院、北方乡村民�?/p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="roof-item">
          <div class="roof-text">
            <h4>高墙防御构�?/h4>
            <p><strong>介绍�?/strong>以高大厚重的砖石围墙环绕宅院，墙体高达数米且坚固密实，部分还搭配瞭望孔、射击孔与碉楼等辅助设施。整体构造能有效阻挡外部盗匪入侵，同时保护宅院内部隐私与安全，兼具防护与威慑作用�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>福建土楼、晋派大院、客家围�?/p>
          </div>
          <div class="roof-image">
            <div class="image-slot">高墙防御构造配图待补充</div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="roof-item reverse">
          <div class="roof-image">
            <div class="image-slot">天井排水构造配图待补充</div>
          </div>
          <div class="roof-text">
            <h4>天井排水构�?/h4>
            <p><strong>介绍�?/strong>在民居内部设置天井，天井地面特意设计平缓坡度，底部铺设砖石并预留隐蔽排水口，部分还搭配暗沟与庭院外河道相连。降雨时，雨水顺着屋顶坡面汇入天井，再通过坡度引导快速流入排水口排出，避免积水浸泡房屋基础�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>徽派民居、苏派民居、岭南天井民�?/p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="roof-item">
          <div class="roof-text">
            <h4>防火构�?/h4>
            <p><strong>介绍�?/strong>以高出屋面的马头墙、独立防火墙为核心，配合砖石砌筑的分隔墙体，将密集排布的民居划分为独立防火单元。当一处房屋失火时，高大的防火构造能阻挡火势向相邻建筑蔓延，有效减少火灾损失�?/p>
            <p><strong>代表�?/strong>徽派马头墙、江南民居防火墙、潮汕民居防火分�?/p>
          </div>
          <div class="roof-image">
            <div class="image-slot">防火构造配图待补充</div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

